FacturxVerifyVerdict_unchanged = Nothing to repair automatically
FacturxVerifyHeadline_ready = This file follows the official rules: it is ready to be sent to your certified platform.
FacturxVerifyHeadline_not_ready = This file would be refused under the official rules: %s blocking point(s) to fix before sending it.
FacturxVerifyHeadline_not_evaluated = Not all the requested rules could be checked: do not send this file as if it were verified.
FacturxVerifyHeadline_error = The check did not complete (key, quota or network). Nothing was concluded about the file.
